      "knowledge_id": "unirank-method-infnet",
      "decision": "considered",
      "rationale": "Read pinned benchmark forward/blocks and benchmark primary summary. Task-aware hubs are nearby work, but field/global pooling and inherited scaled attention are retained to isolate the locally observed scale tradeoff. Original method full text is unavailable in the authorized registry.",
